# STAT - Disk, file and memory status

```text
STAT [drive: | filespec | MEM]
```

## Disk space

STAT lists free space for drives logged into this session. Name a drive
to request its space directly. DSK: with a drive shows its disk
characteristics.

```text
STAT
STAT B:
STAT B:DSK:
```

## Files and memory

```text
STAT B3:*.COM
STAT MEM
```

The filespec selects directory entries in B3. MEM reports transient
memory and the maximum COM size available with the current extensions
loaded. Use [RSX](RSX.HLP) to identify loaded providers.
